      "zh": "这个板条箱的重量超过了电梯限重。"
    },
    {
      "word": "willing",
      "spelling": "W, I, L, L, I, N, G",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，愿意的",
      "en": "Several staff are willing to work the extra Sunday shift.",
      "zh": "有几位员工愿意加班上周日班。"
    },
    {
      "word": "window",
      "spelling": "W, I, N, D, O, W",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，窗户，时间窗口",
      "en": "There is a two-hour delivery window tomorrow morning.",
      "zh": "明天上午有一个两小时的送货时间窗口。"
    },
    {
      "word": "urban",
      "spelling": "U, R, B, A, N",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，城市的",
      "en": "Urban stores have asked for more frequent, smaller deliveries.",
      "zh": "城市门店要求更频繁、量更小的送货。"
    },
    {
      "word": "urge",
      "spelling": "U, R, G, E",
      "spoken_meaning": "动词或名词，敦促，强烈建议",
      "en": "We urge all staff to complete the safety quiz this week.",
      "zh": "我们敦促所有员工本周完成安全测验。"
    },
    {
      "word": "usage",
      "spelling": "U, S, A, G, E",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，使用，用量",
      "en": "Electricity usage fell after the lighting upgrade.",
      "zh": "照明升级后用电量下降了。"
    },
    {
      "word": "useful",
      "spelling": "U, S, E, F, U, L",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，有用的",
      "en": "A barcode scanner would be useful during the stock count.",
      "zh": "盘点时条码扫描器会很有用。"
    },
    {
      "word": "user",
      "spelling": "U, S, E, R",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，用户",
      "en": "Each user must change the temporary password on first login.",
      "zh": "每位用户必须在首次登录时更改临时密码。"
    },
    {
      "word": "usual",
      "spelling": "U, S, U, A, L",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，通常的",
