      "spoken_meaning": "副词，通常",
      "en": "The shuttle usually leaves at 7:10 a.m. sharp.",
      "zh": "班车通常在早上7:10准时出发。"
    },
    {
      "word": "value",
      "spelling": "V, A, L, U, E",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词或动词，价值，重视",
      "en": "We value punctuality in all customer appointments.",
      "zh": "我们重视所有客户预约的准时。"
    },
    {
      "word": "variable",
      "spelling": "V, A, R, I, A, B, L, E",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词或形容词，可变的，变量",
      "en": "Delivery times are variable during the holiday season.",
      "zh": "假日旺季的送货时间是可变的。"
    },
    {
      "word": "various",
      "spelling": "V, A, R, I, O, U, S",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，各种各样的",
      "en": "The kit contains various adapters for overseas travel.",
      "zh": "套装包含各种海外旅行用的转接头。"
    },
    {
      "word": "vast",
      "spelling": "V, A, S, T",
      "spoken_meaning": "形容词，巨大的，广阔的",
      "en": "A vast majority of customers chose the two-year warranty.",
      "zh": "绝大多数客户选择了两年保修。"
    },
    {
      "word": "vessel",
      "spelling": "V, E, S, S, E, L",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，船只，容器",
      "en": "The vessel is due to leave the port on Thursday evening.",
      "zh": "该船定于周四晚上离港。"
    },
    {
      "word": "via",
      "spelling": "V, I, A",
      "spoken_meaning": "介词，经由，通过",
      "en": "Please send the documents via the courier, not by regular mail.",
      "zh": "请用快递寄送文件，不要用普通平邮。"
    },
    {
      "word": "vicinity",
      "spelling": "V, I, C, I, N, I, T, Y",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，附近，邻近地区",
      "en": "Staff may park in the public garage in the vicinity of the office.",
      "zh": "员工可把车停在办公室附近的公共车库。"
    },
    {
      "word": "video",
      "spelling": "V, I, D, E, O",
      "spoken_meaning": "名词，视频",
      "en": "A short safety video must be watched before you enter the plant.",
      "zh": "进入工厂前必须观看一段简短的安全视频。"
    },
